deliverables
tools/wheels

# Local-only trees that are large and irrelevant to a hosted run. Left in, they
# made the build context 2,566 MB - 1,671 MB of third-party research clones and
# 827 MB of video renders - which a host has to upload before it can build
# anything. None of it is an input to the console or the API.
research
video
graphify-out
.agents
.codewhale
brag-output*

# The release bundle is the shipped deliverable: predict.load_artifacts() must
# work from a fresh clone or container with no training step. Re-include it
# after the broad artifact exclusions above.
!models/release
!models/release/**

# The committed pre-windowed CIC-IDS2017 aggregate, for the same reason. The
# `*.parquet` rule above is what excluded it, so without this the image ships
# with no real data and the console silently falls back to synthetic replay.
!data/derived
!data/derived/*.parquet
!data/derived/*.json
